ligned}\\frac{x}{3}=\\frac{\\pi }{12}-\\frac{2\\pi }{3}+2n\\pi , & \\,\\frac{x}{3}=\\frac{\\pi }{12}-\\frac{2\\pi }{3}+2n\\pi  \\\\ \\frac{x}{3}=-\\frac{7\\pi }{12}+2n\\pi , & \\,\\frac{x}{3}=-\\frac{\\pi }{4}+2n\\pi  \\\\ x=-\\frac{7\\pi }{4}+6n\\pi , & \\,x=-\\frac{3\\pi }{4}+6n\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have that $a=-\\frac{7\\pi }{4}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-42790/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3ea83062-5744-52ef-9b3e-f9805ed092fb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-42790"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-121063/selection/a59e10e9ca0b8a69d2b8425f1c9930ee0733ea061a1d6430398562813d750649" :answer/id #uuid "8a56db1d-606d-5a00-b879-9811ecb47105" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "120" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121063/selection/42aff35720b567089407a2a0cf7c70ff6334c9493e4d877ecdcdfa86adae004c" :answer/id #uuid "cae3add0-5be4-59b2-8f55-557047f0fced" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "150" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121063/selection/23a7b929cccc5bdeb88db3bdc770afbaf59570d63e930fc5c94f26cb6f5091dc" :answer/id #uuid "f2406471-bd0a-5d32-aa2a-b766ecaf6c17" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "60" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121063/selection/f9ce6d2531e925e028befc33f5bb5202bf5c98dc29df5818c58d5bd59c914412" :answer/id #uuid "8524bb1f-3498-5464-b26e-76f0f4870166" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "90" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121063/selection/a4c8bdda186d0d425e9963bf17967cd5e356d934f319fa58135b8f8cf8a589f8" :answer/id #uuid "89990881-3fb1-59b1-a3cf-3c3f4a573c23" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "30" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121063/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e4dc6734-8d5b-5e04-ad24-2e4aa638e678" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-121063/selection/23a7b