e the value of $a?$" :question/worked-solution "The given equation is equivalent to \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{tan}⁡3x=-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}.\n$$\n\nSo, the general solution to our equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x & =-\\frac{\\pi }{6}+n\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving the above equation for $x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =-\\frac{\\pi }{18}+\\frac{n\\pi }{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have that $a=-\\frac{1}{18}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-121066/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "97786302-e865-5581-b08e-8da7c6b7a01b"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-121066"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-121071/selection/1ad763bfa28dd8bf929699f6c31cff536336c19979c6baa533b7a886875a37b7" :answer/id #uuid "f05f92c8-c06b-5b18-919d-5c831c3ce26f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "270" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121071/selection/557015e94af5fa4bd02ae0ff131d8572cb165f5648829317508c9b9e01215bfe" :answer/id #uuid "9d889096-41d0-5c10-a077-ffd7f30baffe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "240" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121071/selection/fa2764e4d443b0fd1a8b9b79f38b985d2b576f72681c3b867c06cfeb24c839e4" :answer/id #uuid "dba553fe-eba7-5d9b-ad97-eb008720e333" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "360" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121071/selection/cd2c691ab81e402742a9cbfcf84eae9c0333da43cb9c250de23e4aff9fbca764" :answer/id #uuid "46b832ec-3d9f-51ea-8063-fe283d499712" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "480" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121071/selection/e12f73422a456eca8c83cae70999c506825a539631c33c529fb793c051a91c96" :answer/id #uuid "9b3fe27c-441f-529d-b735-ef4dcc98582b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "450" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-121071/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "9682efdf-8129-5464-ac1f-474669f9712e" :answer-field/key "sele